{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Dungeon Market Simulator</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3816300/extras/558645267493f0c42368fcc3d3716858.poster.avif?t=1752651689\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3816300/extras/558645267493f0c42368fcc3d3716858.webm?t=1752651689\" type=\"video/webm\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3816300/extras/558645267493f0c42368fcc3d3716858.mp4?t=1752651689\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A cunning dwarf wants to run an ancestral shop in the heart of the medieval world. Set deadly traps in dungeons to hunt down outcast warriors and loot their arcane goods.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3816300/extras/0c413aa18ba66700223cb82a8161623d.poster.avif?t=1752651689\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3816300/extras/0c413aa18ba66700223cb82a8161623d.webm?t=1752651689\" type=\"video/webm\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3816300/extras/0c413aa18ba66700223cb82a8161623d.mp4?t=1752651689\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Crack mystical chests and level up items. The more strategic your trap system, the more mystical chests you'll discover.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3816300/extras/66d94632249e8630cb73d36e5783d870.poster.avif?t=1752651689\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3816300/extras/66d94632249e8630cb73d36e5783d870.webm?t=1752651689\" type=\"video/webm\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3816300/extras/66d94632249e8630cb73d36e5783d870.mp4?t=1752651689\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">There are over 100 unique arcane items waiting to be sold in your shop. There are also various upgrade totems to increase your power and profit.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3816300?t=1752651689","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3816300/4077f3e9a29318b80f9ad1102dd38305d134d695/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1752651689","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3816300/2a468d35dc0843ba09efcf6e637fb4cffc349fd8/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1752651689","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3816300/2a468d35dc0843ba09efcf6e637fb4cffc349fd8/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1752651689","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Dungeon Market Simulator</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3816300/extras/558645267493f0c42368fcc3d3716858.poster.avif?t=1752651689\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3816300/extras/558645267493f0c42368fcc3d3716858.webm?t=1752651689\" type=\"video/webm\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3816300/extras/558645267493f0c42368fcc3d3716858.mp4?t=1752651689\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A cunn